       10      787   0.24715    0.005690    0.007305      43.4      33.8   1.28
       30      742   0.24716    0.005153    0.006114      48.0      40.4   1.19
      100      649   0.24723    0.003964    0.004409      62.4      56.1   1.11
      300      524   0.24736    0.002750    0.002959      89.9      83.6   1.08

  배포 상수:  SMOOTH_K_PITCHER = 200   CTX_K = 200   ASOF_STRENGTH = 35
  λ_EB(min_n=30, 적률) = 48.0   →  SMOOTH_K 대비 0.24배

